cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolbox in scientific work, please cite both the software (this entry) and the ERA5-Land dataset (preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: "era5land-arcgis-tools"
abstract: >-
  ArcGIS Pro Python toolbox for processing ERA5-Land daily NetCDF
  data into GIS-ready GeoTIFFs and derived climate indicators.
  Four tools: NetCDF to GeoTIFF conversion (variable-agnostic),
  NetCDF inspection (debug), climate indicator computation
  (48 metrics across 6 categories including ETCCDI extremes,
  Spinoni HDD/CDD, WMO normals, and G.POT-oriented heating /
  cooling season lengths), and regional zonal time-series
  extraction to long-format CSV. Companion downloader
  (era5land-downloads) automates batch acquisition from the
  DestinE Earth Data Hub Zarr store or the Copernicus CDS API.
